{"ref":"BDB, עֻזָּא","hw":"עֻזָּא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזָּא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Οζα, Αζα:<br><strong>1.</strong>  driver of the ark <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.3\">2 S 6:3</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזָּה</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:8\" href=\"/Psalms.6.8\">8</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.7\">1 Ch 13:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.11\">11</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּן־עֻזָּא</span> burial-place of Manasseh and Amon <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.18\">2 K 21:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.26\">26</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> perhaps = <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּיָּה</span>, cf. Sta<sup>G i. 569, ii. 679</sup> Kit).<br><strong>3.</strong>  Benjamite name <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.7\">1 Ch 8:7</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  head of family of returned exiles <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:49\" href=\"/Ezra.2.49\">Ezr 2:49</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:50\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.50\">Ne 7:51</a>.","next":"BDB, עֻזָּה","prev":"BDB, עָזָז"}